{"id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-regular.md","title":"Regular positive Boolean function","display":"df-regular — Regular positive Boolean function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-regular","aliases":["27-df-regular"],"display":"df-regular — Regular positive Boolean function","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-monotone]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-regular"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-regular</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular — Regular positive Boolean function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 表示逐坐标非减的正函数类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a>。</li>\n<li>引入定义于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\\times[n]\">\\([n]\\times[n]\\)</span> 的变量强度关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succeq_f\">\\(\\succeq_f\\)</span>、置换集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n\">\\(S_n\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regular}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"i\\succeq_f j\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ i=j\\ \\lor\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left[\\left(x_i=1\\land x_j=0\\land y_i=0\\land y_j=1\\land\\forall k\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i,j\\}\\;(x_k=y_k)\\right)\\longrightarrow f(x)\\geq f(y)\\right]\\quad(i,j\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[i\\succeq_f j\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ i=j\\ \\lor\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left[\\left(x_i=1\\land x_j=0\\land y_i=0\\land y_j=1\\land\\forall k\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i,j\\}\\;(x_k=y_k)\\right)\\longrightarrow f(x)\\geq f(y)\\right]\\quad(i,j\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_n\\coloneqq\\{\\pi:[n]\\to[n]\\mid\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(\\pi(i)=\\pi(j)\\longrightarrow i=j)\\land\\forall j\\in[n]\\;\\exists i\\in[n]\\;(\\pi(i)=j)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_n\\coloneqq\\{\\pi:[n]\\to[n]\\mid\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(\\pi(i)=\\pi(j)\\longrightarrow i=j)\\land\\forall j\\in[n]\\;\\exists i\\in[n]\\;(\\pi(i)=j)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(i\\succeq_f j\\lor j\\succeq_f i)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(i\\succeq_f j\\lor j\\succeq_f i)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §8.1，Definitions 8.2、8.3，印刷 pp.352、354／PDF pp.376、378；已核对定义。变量强度适用于任意布尔函数，regular 则必须是正函数并具有完全强度预序；原有正文遗漏了正性。</li>\n<li>用两个完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 维点定义交换比较，明确处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=j\">\\(i=j\\)</span>，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0,1\">\\(n=0,1\\)</span> 时出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^{n-2}\">\\(\\mathbb B^{n-2}\\)</span>。从强到弱的排列是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(1)\\succeq_f\\cdots\\succeq_f\\pi(n)\">\\(\\pi(1)\\succeq_f\\cdots\\succeq_f\\pi(n)\\)</span>；排列存在性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28287ff9da7cda0e\" href=\"?note=28287ff9da7cda0e\" title=\"27-thm-regrecog\">27-thm-regrecog</a> 给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-monotone]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 表示逐坐标非减的正函数类，见 [[27-df-monotone]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-regrecog","status":"resolved","id":"28287ff9da7cda0e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"用两个完整 $n$ 维点定义交换比较，明确处理 $i=j$，避免 $n=0,1$ 时出现 $\\mathbb B^{n-2}$。从强到弱的排列是 $\\pi(1)\\succeq_f\\cdots\\succeq_f\\pi(n)$；排列存在性由 [[27-thm-regrecog]] 给出。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"[n]\\times[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\succeq_f","display":false},{"tex":"S_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Regular}_n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\succeq_f j\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ i=j\\ \\lor\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left[\\left(x_i=1\\land x_j=0\\land y_i=0\\land y_j=1\\land\\forall k\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i,j\\}\\;(x_k=y_k)\\right)\\longrightarrow f(x)\\geq f(y)\\right]\\quad(i,j\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"S_n\\coloneqq\\{\\pi:[n]\\to[n]\\mid\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(\\pi(i)=\\pi(j)\\longrightarrow i=j)\\land\\forall j\\in[n]\\;\\exists i\\in[n]\\;(\\pi(i)=j)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Regular}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(i\\succeq_f j\\lor j\\succeq_f i)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"i=j","display":false},{"tex":"n=0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^{n-2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi(1)\\succeq_f\\cdots\\succeq_f\\pi(n)","display":false}],"bytes":1624,"backlinks":[{"id":"51cb6796716e54e8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 与变量强度 $\\succeq_f$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-regular|df-regular — Regular positive Boolean function]]"},{"id":"2be78d64f33cd0ea","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Regular}_n$ 和 $\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]，其中后者指正的逐坐标非减函数类。"},{"id":"28287ff9da7cda0e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$[n],S_n,\\